Text: "Expressions denote values, predicates, mappings, collections, calls, and
operator applications. This section gives the implemented surface shapes and
important validation rules for every expression family, including grouping,
commands, builds, variadics, specifications, and labels. Consult Precedence in
the parent section when several forms occur together."
Id: "b665c25f-598f-409b-8507-0e7e27fc5f1c"
